description "Settlement Officer Rune Haako

A stunted slimeball who'd prefer to advise the other guy.

^2Weaponry:
- Unskilled Melee
-- 100% slower RoF
-- Punch/block only
- E-5 Blaster Rifle (DC Carb 3)
-- 100% slower RoF
-- 400% slower reload
- Security Resolution (Minigun 3)
-- Tracks/poisons/drains on hit
-- Unblockable
-- Hitscan charges
-- 99% less damage
-- 3000% slower RoF

^5Powers:
- Absorbing Wealth (2) ^9{Dark's Beacon}

^6Inventory:
- Medpac
- OOM-series Security Droid (Support Beacon) ^3[CS2]
- Portable Forcefield ^3[CS4]
- Assault Sentry ^3[CS3]
- Seeker Drone

^8Attributes:
- OOM-series Security Droid (Bodyguard)
- Healing (3)
- Recharge (2)
- 100% slower skill cooldown
- 40% less knockback given
- 25% more knockback taken
- No Gunbash
- No Pickups

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]

Rune Haako is significantly more paranoid than Gunray and more pessimistic; however, he is able to provide sound advice to the often panic-stricken Viceroy, and often prevents a bad situation from becoming worse."